                </a>
                <a href="https://twitter.com/intent/tweet?url=https://thericetour.com/leo-nui-o-ladakh" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-[#1DA1F2]/10 text-[#1DA1F2] flex items-center justify-center hover:bg-[#1DA1F2] hover:text-white transition-colors" title="Chia sẻ lên Twitter">
